    <string name="hr_title">Why Cyclus uses Health Connect</string>
    <string name="hr_read">Reading: Cyclus brings in bleeding, periods, spotting, temperature, discharge, LH tests and sexual activity from other apps and watches so predictions and patterns are complete. Only while Cyclus is open.</string>
    <string name="hr_write">Writing: only for categories you turn on in Cyclus. Everything is off by default.</string>
    <string name="hr_local">Everything stays on your device. Cyclus has no internet permission and no servers.</string>
    <string name="hr_revoke">You can remove access at any time in Health Connect or in Cyclus under Privacy › Health Connect.</string>
